  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3106 specifies the quality of service (QoS) functional requirements for the International Mobile Telecommunications-2020 (IMT- 2020) network.This Recommendation first provides an overview of QoS requirements for IMT-2020. It then describes the high-level QoS capabilities of the IMT-2020 network, which include: QoS planning, QoS provisioning, QoS monitoring and QoS optimization. Based on these capabilities, Recommendation ITU-T Y.3106 specifies the QoS functional requirements for the IMT-2020 network.</abstract>
